     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: rwayland3<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=133148<br/>\nOriginator: YES</p>\n\n\n<p>fedora.client.utility.AutoFinder is passing in values of null/null for username/password when it attempts to create an instance of FedoraClient. A null value for username is not allowed downstream which is generating the error message: \"Username may not be null\".</p>",
